[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922741308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106951#issuecomment-2922741308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106951","id":2922741308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uNX48","user":{"login":"cridenour","id":175568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTU2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour","html_url":"https://github.com/cridenour","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cridenour/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T15:44:10Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T15:44:10Z","body":"Thank you @celyk for this fantastic work. \r\n\r\nI've tested the MRPs and this affects the following:\r\n\r\nCloses #104654\r\nCloses #101139\r\nCloses #76388\r\nCloses #89061\r\nCloses #73383\r\nSupersedes #89165","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922741308/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924021005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106951#issuecomment-2924021005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106951","id":2924021005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uSQUN","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T02:27:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T02:27:17Z","body":"> the transforms are just using single precision\r\n\r\nYes, but the transformation from model to view space does not need double. The translation component of the transformation is small enough because it's centred around the camera.\r\n\r\n> when transforming the vertex we lose the extra precision and effectively do a single precision transformation\r\n\r\nThis is what you do anyway? The vertex never goes into double_add_vec3(), and the translation uses regular addition.\r\n\r\n> This PR completely removes that operation and combines everything ahead of time\r\n\r\nBut I was careful not to alter calls to double_add_vec3(). Notice that each of those calls should give the same output as before, thus respecting the error term.\r\n\r\nWhether the final translation is applied through an addition or a translation matrix, what difference does it make? Either way it becomes a single precision addition by the end.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924021005/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2926310682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106951#issuecomment-2926310682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106951","id":2926310682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ua_Ua","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-01T02:27:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-01T02:27:17Z","body":"Tested using Calinou's [Large World Coordinates demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/large_world_coordinates)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1593\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4db2add-dcff-4b8f-9b61-21d98fbf4447\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2926310682/rea